        <mda:meta type="pos_id">52</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>United Stations supplied that one. It has all the tools a doc would need. Ha... medication too. It also includes quality chemistry and biology sets, and... stuff. Woulda known better had I used it.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
