        <mda:meta type="pos_id">72</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>The United Stations were helpin' the Junkyarders before the Free Drone attack. They were giving out food and clothes. Food...&lt;end&gt;</source>
