        <mda:meta type="pos_id">74</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>That certainly bought their affection. Quite cheap, though, but them folks got next to nothin', so it makes sense.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
