      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">78</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Never said that. I also benefited from their "generosity." But what I said is true, them guys ain't stupid. They ain't. Well, not until this happened...&lt;end&gt;</source>
